---
exclusions:
  template-job-rule:
    reason: Jobs are not set to multi in our case.
  template-instance-rule:
    reason: We use instance variable as a single-select.
  panel-datasource-rule:
    reason: Using a datasource for each panel.
  panel-title-description-rule:
    reason: TODO(adinhodovic)
  target-instance-rule:
  target-rate-interval-rule:
  target-job-rule:
    reason: Health probe series come from the blackbox_exporter job, filtered by healthProbe.selector.
    entries:
      - dashboard: Vault / Overview
        panel: Sealed Nodes
      - dashboard: Vault / Overview
        panel: Uninitialized Nodes
      - dashboard: Vault / Overview
        panel: Unreachable Nodes
      - dashboard: Vault / Overview
        panel: Node Health Status
